        <activityName xml:lang="en">Potassium permanganate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Potassium permanganate, at plant
The multioutput-process "Manganese dioxide oxidation" delivers the co-products potassium permanganate and hydrogen. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: 87728454-5685-366a-a406-7c006c4fb8b7
